              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze Yesu, ntumye malaika wange okubakobera ebintu bino mu bikunsu eby'abandhikiriza. Ndi wa ku luzi lwa Daudi era nsimuka mu oyo. Ninze emuunienie ey'oku nkyo eyaka einho.”",
