        {
          "text": "Ate alikendeeza ku bibono eby'obulanzi ebiri mu kitabo kino, Katonda alimutoolaku omugabo gwe ogw'oku muti ogw'obulamu, n'ogw'omu kibuga ekitukuvu ebighandiikiibwaku mu kitabo kino.",
